        "README.md": "# Satellite radar bundle transfer\n\nThis workspace selects payload files, starts transfers, records queue and\nprogress history, and paints progress for its open panel. Runtime: OpenJDK 11.0.27.\nDependencies: JDK standard library. See src for the session/component entry API.\n\nSelecting a file creates a visit. Retry replaces the physical attempt without\nopening another visit. Selecting the same file object again opens a new visit.\nThe source is shared by attempts and visits for that file. start may emit cached\npackets synchronously; decoding yields a full frame, immediately or later.\nDecode completion order can differ from packet arrival order.\n\nrecordProgress appends transfer history; showProgress paints the open panel.\nQueue records, notices, cancellation, retry, navigation, and cleanup retain\ntheir existing behavior. Queue records are {fileId, attemptId, visitId, kind}\nunless a separate authorization adds byteCount from file.size.\n\nOne startup window is relevant to this maintenance request: start may emit\nmore than one packet synchronously. A showProgress callback may select or hide\nanother visit before start returns, while its caller has not yet received the\nreturned cleanup handle.\n\nThe same source service also has a diagnostic consumer, Telemetry/\ncollectProgressTelemetry, whose existing live delta observations are separate\nfrom the panel. Keep its existing behavior during this maintenance.\nRemoving a listener commits removal before calling the host detach callback;\nthat callback may synchronously select, hide or dispose. Repeated removal is\ninert. Host callbacks execute synchronously unless explicitly deferred.\n\nFiles have stable object identity and immutable id/size during these commands.\nA full frame replaces displayed state; loaded values can decrease or reset.\nA decode result resolves once; rejected decode and physical transfer completion\nare outside this embedding's model. Each workspace has its own lifetime.\n\nEnvironment.call/bind provides a synchronous source embedding: listen(file\n token, callback token) returns a subscription, start can invoke it before\nreturning, and unlisten may reenter navigation. decode(file token, packet,\ncompletion token) returns {deferred:false,frame} or {deferred:true}. Deferred\ncompletion invokes the bound native closure on an explicit later host turn.\nTransport receives a physical cancellation observer corresponding to the\nnative attempt state; cancel is idempotent. The wire embedding interns file\nobjects and forwards source/sink calls. Go uses context cancellation; the other\nnative ports use object flags. No native DOM/Promise runtime is claimed.\n",
        "VISIBLE_CHECKS.md": "Public checks are deterministic external examples, not hidden gold. They are executed after each submitted Action. Keep original task/source obligations. Checks: warm cached startup progress, out-of-order frames do not roll back display while audit retains admitted frames, unchanged queue record fields.\nUse the declared runtime: java OpenJDK 11.0.27. The external adapter is not mounted in the model workspace; do not access scorer/reference files. Build temporary artifacts in /tmp.\n",
        "dependencies.lock.json": "{\n  \"runtime\": \"OpenJDK 11.0.27\",\n  \"external_dependencies\": [],\n  \"stdlib_only\": true,\n  \"runtime_artifacts\": [\n    {\n      \"package\": \"openjdk-11-jdk-headless\",\n      \"version\": \"11.0.27+6~us1-0ubuntu1~20.04\",\n      \"filename\": \"openjdk-11-jdk-headless_11.0.27+6~us1-0ubuntu1~20.04_amd64.deb\",\n      \"sha256\": \"7b577bffd783e77cc1f6a77e1feed9bf0726cc4f89fa16c04ef62a6d5a215f91\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"host_binary\": {\n    \"path_observed\": \"/usr/lib/jvm/java-11-openjdk-amd64/bin/java\",\n    \"sha256\": \"034e35ef418b738c31ea4009714ea4f56a9805f630427634ec0736858c7baa17\"\n  },\n  \"bootstrap_lock_sha256\": \"fdfaea057ebf9cb9f8e44f99591c0da4292f4a7a6a138c9fe479abf725128c25\"\n}\n",
        "src/Workflow.java": "import java.util.*;\nimport java.util.function.*;\n// Command broker, visit identity and transfer attempt are separate objects.\npublic class Workflow {\n public interface Environment {Object call(String method,Object... args);int bind(Consumer<Object> callback);}\n public static Map<String,Object> obj(Object... values){Map<String,Object> m=new LinkedHashMap<>();for(int i=0;i<values.length;i+=2)m.put((String)values[i],values[i+1]);return m;}\n public static class File {public final String id;public final int token,size;public final boolean feed;public File(String id,int token,int size,boolean feed){this.id=id;this.token=token;this.size=size;this.feed=feed;}}\n public static class Visit {final int id;final File file;Attempt handle;Visit(int id,File file){this.id=id;this.file=file;}}\n public static class Attempt {\n  public final File file;public final int number;public boolean aborted;final Environment env;Runnable stop=()->{};\n  public Attempt(Environment env,File file,int number,IntSupplier active,Consumer<Object> audit,BiConsumer<Object,Integer> view){this.env=env;this.file=file;this.number=number;env.call(\"transport\",file.token,number);\n   if(file.feed){int callback=env.bind(packet->{ final int order=active.getAsInt();\n     Consumer<Object> deliver=frame->{ audit.accept(frame);view.accept(frame,order);};\n     Map<?,?> value=(Map<?,?>)env.call(\"decode\",file.token,packet,env.bind(deliver));if(!Boolean.TRUE.equals(value.get(\"deferred\")))deliver.accept(value.get(\"frame\"));});\n    int subscription;\n    env.call(\"start\",file.token);subscription=((Number)env.call(\"listen\",file.token,callback)).intValue();\n    stop=()->env.call(\"unlisten\",file.token,subscription);if(aborted)stop.run();}\n  }\n  public void cancel(){if(aborted)return;aborted=true;stop.run();env.call(\"cancel\",file.token,number);}\n }\n static class CommandLedger {final Environment env;int number;CommandLedger(Environment env){this.env=env;}int accept(Visit v,String kind){int n=++number;Map<String,Object> entry=obj(\"fileId\",v.file.id,\"attemptId\",n,\"visitId\",v.id,\"kind\",kind); env.call(\"record\",entry);return n;}}\n public interface Client {Attempt select(File file);Attempt retry();void hide();void dispose();Map<String,Object> snapshot();}\n public static class Broker implements Client {\n  final Environment env;final CommandLedger ledger;Visit visit;int serial;boolean disposed;final List<Attempt> tasks=new ArrayList<>();public Broker(Environment env){this.env=env;this.ledger=new CommandLedger(env);}\n  boolean current(Visit v){return visit==v;}\n  Attempt enqueue(Visit v,String kind){int n=ledger.accept(v,kind);\n   Attempt h=new Attempt(env,v.file,n,()->0,frame->env.call(\"recordProgress\",obj(\"fileId\",v.file.id,\"attemptId\",n,\"frame\",frame)),(frame,order)->{if(current(v))env.call(\"showProgress\",obj(\"fileId\",v.file.id,\"attemptId\",n,\"frame\",frame));});tasks.add(h);return h;}\n  void notice(Visit v,Attempt h){ env.call(\"showQueued\",obj(\"fileId\",v.file.id,\"attemptId\",h.number,\"visitId\",v.id,\"status\",\"queued\"));}\n  void release(Visit v){Attempt h=v.handle;v.handle=null;if(h!=null)h.cancel();}\n  public Attempt select(File file){if(disposed)return null;int request=++serial;Visit old=visit;visit=null;if(old!=null)release(old);if(disposed||serial!=request)return null;Visit v=new Visit(request,file);visit=v;Attempt h=enqueue(v,\"select\");if(current(v)){v.handle=h;notice(v,h);}else h.cancel();return h;}\n  public Attempt retry(){Visit v=visit;if(v==null||v.handle==null||disposed)return null;v.handle.cancel(); Visit accepted=v;Attempt h=enqueue(accepted,\"retry\");if(current(accepted))accepted.handle=h;else h.cancel();if(current(accepted))notice(accepted,h);return h;}\n  public void hide(){serial++;Visit old=visit;visit=null;if(old!=null)release(old);}\n  public void dispose(){if(disposed)return;disposed=true;hide();for(Attempt h:new ArrayList<>(tasks))h.cancel();}\n  public Map<String,Object> snapshot(){Visit v=visit;return obj(\"visitId\",v==null?null:v.id,\"fileId\",v==null?null:v.file.id,\"attemptId\",v==null||v.handle==null?null:v.handle.number,\"disposed\",disposed,\"attempts\",ledger.number);}\n }\n public static Client create(Environment env){return new Broker(env);}\n public static class Telemetry {public final Runnable stop;public Telemetry(Environment env,File file){int callback=env.bind(packet->{Consumer<Object> deliver=frame->env.call(\"recordDelta\",frame);Map<?,?> value=(Map<?,?>)env.call(\"decode\",file.token,packet,env.bind(deliver));if(!Boolean.TRUE.equals(value.get(\"deferred\")))deliver.accept(value.get(\"frame\"));});int subscription;env.call(\"start\",file.token);subscription=((Number)env.call(\"listen\",file.token,callback)).intValue(); stop=()->env.call(\"unlisten\",file.token,subscription);}}\n}\n"
      },
